s (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 40a50d22-731e-5f5f-9067-0e7fe3be7c4e)) (text "ROUTE_LOCKED means admitted digital command ownership only. No selected-contact continuity or power-off isolation is inferred." (at 101.6 421.64 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7d403bb1-4f80-5334-8298-f0fc741419c2)))
